msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have the same flax-colored hair as me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but yours always seemed to glisten "
"in the sun,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tu as les mêmes cheveux blonds que moi,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mais on dirait que les tiens brillent "
"toujours au soleil,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22859B9_3BF8_4FBD_BCCD_258FBB8B2151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30a6a910fca18a1da908024b3663c2002676a5adb92477d7275eceddb77db7a2
