msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I would eventually have to find some kind of work—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫some way to support "
"myself and Nellie—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je savais qu’un jour je devrais trouver du travail,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫pour nous faire vivre, "
"Nellie et moi,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef37e63d5e2ef34046605d8550438ff36b9e98eb0fb5b0b906c8a0bcbc755996
