msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even so, it was still a constant stream of new experiences for the two of us, having been "
"pampered our entire lives."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Malgré cela, on faisait constamment de nouvelles expériences, vu comme on avait été "
"chouchouté toute notre vie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ACCF1210_14B3_4155_8256_1D728A00FD16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
