msgid "⟪k:0⟫...What are her symptoms?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Quels sont ses symptômes ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2309615B_CFDA_4903_9738_9BD67A636B0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
