msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sound tickled my curiosity. I wanted to know what she looked like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le son de sa voix aiguisa ma curiosité. Je voulais savoir à quoi elle ressemblait."

#: scenario8:scenario8_03603705_9AB8_4EDA_BDE6_C3F6DD31AFCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6407ac72cc2b578161e2ce694f1da5a21c08adca024c5610b9cdbead1a54681c
