msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Most of her face was covered by a black hood, so all I could see was her mouth and chin, but "
"even that much was harrowing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La plus grande partie de son visage était recouverte d’une capuche noire, donc tout ce que "
"je pouvais voir c’était sa bouche et son menton, mais rien que ça, déjà, c’était déchirant."

#: scenario8:scenario8_70F924A4_7A6B_48A8_9B29_6B8565026318
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67773c297919d2c95e2d514f2efa21951a756ae7a3896908a0b9398baef84419
