msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was conflicted. Part of me hoped we would never arrive at the lake, ⟪k:2⟫and part of "
"me wanted to get there as quickly as possible so I could be done with all this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J’étais déchiré. D’un côté, j’espérais qu’on n’arriverait jamais au lac, ⟪k:2⟫et de "
"l’autre, je voulais arriver le plus vite possible pour en avoir terminé."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6472977B_C25A_4A83_9FE8_D95D462C545C
