msgid "⟪k:0⟫The thought of what was going to happen next filled me with a crushing sense of guilt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un écrasant sentiment de culpabilité m’envahit en pensant à ce qui allait se passer ensuite."

#: scenario8:scenario8_455B8355_E430_4365_BD01_F4663007385C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6aa9068d4e47e0849f3d60bdfef7b005f70930c77af9eece9b3db73a4b1882d5
